{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20263lZhn2RnQz1787307275.jpg\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">深圳當局在新皇崗口岸大樓舉行消防疏散及通關演練。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.BORDER-1600.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026fUPHDDIJ9W1787304837.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CN.BORDER-1600.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">演習周四舉行，約1,000人參與，分批按不同路線進入大樓，模擬過關流程。當局並對扶手電梯及升降機進行壓力測試，檢視滿載的運作情況。並在交通接駁區各個樓層檢驗設施設備運作，期間又模擬消防疏散應急演練。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">深圳口岸辦指，深港兩地近期將聯合舉行萬人大型壓力測試演練。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T10:19:41.558708+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}